{"step_index":1080,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-11-05T06:04:43Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-05T00:04:43-06:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: 5ecd42aa-1b9a-4dda-aec7-a32c9730884f/task-1080\nTask Description: Add-Type -Language CSharp @\"\nusing System;\nusing System.Collections.Concurrent;\nusing System.Net.Sockets;\nusing System.Threading.Tasks;\npublic class NetScanner {\n    public static string[] Scan5555(string prefix) {\n        var bag = new ConcurrentBag<string>();\n        Parallel.For(1, 255, new ParallelOptions { MaxDegreeOfParallelism = 64 }, i => {\n            string ip = prefix + i;\n            try {\n                using (var tcp = new TcpClient()) {\n                    var ar = tcp.BeginConnect(ip, 5555, null, null);\n                    if (ar.AsyncWaitHandle.WaitOne(220)) {\n                        tcp.EndConnect(ar);\n                        bag.Add(ip);\n                    }\n                }\n            } catch {}\n        });\n        return bag.ToArray();\n    }\n}\n\"@\n$ips = [NetScanner]::Scan5555(\"192.168.0.\")\nWrite-Host \"IPs 5555 abiertas: $($ips -join ', ')\"\nforeach ($ip in $ips) {\n    & \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\xview\\programa perfecto\\1_HERRAMIENTAS_MOTOR\\adb.exe\" connect \"$($ip):5555\"\n}\nGet-PnpDevice -PresentOnly | Where-Object { $_.InstanceId -match \"^USB\\\\\" } | Select-Object Status, Class, FriendlyName, InstanceId | Format-Table -AutoSize\n& \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\xview\\programa perfecto\\1_HERRAMIENTAS_MOTOR\\adb.exe\" devices -l\n& \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\xview\\programa perfecto\\1_HERRAMIENTAS_MOTOR\\fastboot_moderno.exe\" devices -l\nTask logs are available at: file:///C:/Users/andre/.gemini/antigravity/brain/5ecd42aa-1b9a-4dda-aec7-a32c9730884f/.system_generated/tasks/task-1080.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simpl